{
  "format": "srwb",
  "format_version": "1.0",
  "exported_at": "2026-08-15T15:52:08.375Z",
  "notebook": {
    "id": "default",
    "name": "R 语言统计分析",
    "autoNameNumber": null,
    "description": "",
    "kernelLanguage": "r",
    "catalogId": null,
    "catalogRevision": null,
    "cellCounter": 18,
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "code": "# R 语言统计分析\n\n使用 R 内置数据集进行假设检验、回归分析和置信区间计算。\n\n无需下载数据或安装软件包 — 仅使用基础 R (Base R)。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "code": "## 1. 描述性统计",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "code": "data(mtcars)\ncat(\"数据集: mtcars (\", nrow(mtcars), \" 辆车, \", ncol(mtcars), \" 个变量)\\n\\n\")\nsummary(mtcars[, c(\"mpg\", \"hp\", \"wt\", \"disp\")])",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "数据集: mtcars ( 32  辆车,  11  个变量)\n\n      mpg              hp              wt             disp      \n Min.   :10.40   Min.   : 52.0   Min.   :1.513   Min.   : 71.1  \n 1st Qu.:15.43   1st Qu.: 96.5   1st Qu.:2.581   1st Qu.:120.8  \n Median :19.20   Median :123.0   Median :3.325   Median :196.3  \n Mean   :20.09   Mean   :146.7   Mean   :3.217   Mean   :230.7  \n 3rd Qu.:22.80   3rd Qu.:180.0   3rd Qu.:3.610   3rd Qu.:326.0  \n Max.   :33.90   Max.   :335.0   Max.   :5.424   Max.   :472.0",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">数据集: mtcars ( 32  辆车,  11  个变量)\n\n      mpg              hp              wt             disp      \n Min.   :10.40   Min.   : 52.0   Min.   :1.513   Min.   : 71.1  \n 1st Qu.:15.43   1st Qu.: 96.5   1st Qu.:2.581   1st Qu.:120.8  \n Median :19.20   Median :123.0   Median :3.325   Median :196.3  \n Mean   :20.09   Mean   :146.7   Mean   :3.217   Mean   :230.7  \n 3rd Qu.:22.80   3rd Qu.:180.0   3rd Qu.:3.610   3rd Qu.:326.0  \n Max.   :33.90   Max.   :335.0   Max.   :5.424   Max.   :472.0</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "code": "## 2. 双样本 t 检验\n\n手动挡汽车的燃油经济性 (MPG) 是否优于自动挡汽车？",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "code": "auto <- mtcars$mpg[mtcars$am == 0]\nmanual <- mtcars$mpg[mtcars$am == 1]\n\ncat(\"自动挡:\", round(mean(auto), 1), \"MPG (n =\", length(auto), \")\\n\")\ncat(\"手动挡:   \", round(mean(manual), 1), \"MPG (n =\", length(manual), \")\\n\\n\")\n\nt_result <- t.test(manual, auto, alternative = \"greater\")\nprint(t_result)\n\ncat(\"\\n结论:\",\n    ifelse(t_result$p.value < 0.05,\n           \"拒绝原假设 H0 — 手动挡汽车的 MPG 显著更高\",\n           \"未能拒绝原假设 H0\"))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "自动挡: 17.1 MPG (n = 19 )\n手动挡:    24.4 MPG (n = 13 )\n\n\n\tWelch Two Sample t-test\n\ndata:  manual and auto\nt = 3.7671, df = 18.332, p-value = 0.0006868\nalternative hypothesis: true difference in means is greater than 0\n95 percent confidence interval:\n 3.913256      Inf\nsample estimates:\nmean of x mean of y \n 24.39231  17.14737 \n\n\n结论: 拒绝原假设 H0 — 手动挡汽车的 MPG 显著更高",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">自动挡: 17.1 MPG (n = 19 )\n手动挡:    24.4 MPG (n = 13 )\n\n\n\tWelch Two Sample t-test\n\ndata:  manual and auto\nt = 3.7671, df = 18.332, p-value = 0.0006868\nalternative hypothesis: true difference in means is greater than 0\n95 percent confidence interval:\n 3.913256      Inf\nsample estimates:\nmean of x mean of y \n 24.39231  17.14737 \n\n\n结论: 拒绝原假设 H0 — 手动挡汽车的 MPG 显著更高</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "code": "## 3. 卡方检验\n\n气缸数与变速箱类型是否相互独立？",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "code": "tab <- table(Cylinders = mtcars$cyl, Transmission = mtcars$am)\ncolnames(tab) <- c(\"自动挡\", \"手动挡\")\nprint(tab)\ncat(\"\\n\")\nchisq.test(tab)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "         Transmission\nCylinders 自动挡 手动挡\n        4      3      8\n        6      4      3\n        8     12      2\n\nWarning in chisq.test(tab) : Chi-squared approximation may be incorrect\n\n\tPearson's Chi-squared test\n\ndata:  tab\nX-squared = 8.7407, df = 2, p-value = 0.01265",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">         Transmission\nCylinders 自动挡 手动挡\n        4      3      8\n        6      4      3\n        8     12      2\n\nWarning in chisq.test(tab) : Chi-squared approximation may be incorrect\n\n\tPearson's Chi-squared test\n\ndata:  tab\nX-squared = 8.7407, df = 2, p-value = 0.01265</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "code": "## 4. 多元线性回归",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "code": "model <- lm(mpg ~ wt + hp + am, data = mtcars)\nsummary(model)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "\nCall:\nlm(formula = mpg ~ wt + hp + am, data = mtcars)\n\nResiduals:\n    Min      1Q  Median      3Q     Max \n-3.4221 -1.7924 -0.3788  1.2249  5.5317 \n\nCoefficients:\n             Estimate Std. Error t value Pr(>|t|)    \n(Intercept) 34.002875   2.642659  12.867 2.82e-13 ***\nwt          -2.878575   0.904971  -3.181 0.003574 ** \nhp          -0.037479   0.009605  -3.902 0.000546 ***\nam           2.083710   1.376420   1.514 0.141268    \n---\nSignif. codes:  0 ‘***’ 0.001 ‘**’ 0.01 ‘*’ 0.05 ‘.’ 0.1 ‘ ’ 1\n\nResidual standard error: 2.538 on 28 degrees of freedom\nMultiple R-squared:  0.8399,\tAdjusted R-squared:  0.8227 \nF-statistic: 48.96 on 3 and 28 DF,  p-value: 2.908e-11",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">\nCall:\nlm(formula = mpg ~ wt + hp + am, data = mtcars)\n\nResiduals:\n    Min      1Q  Median      3Q     Max \n-3.4221 -1.7924 -0.3788  1.2249  5.5317 \n\nCoefficients:\n             Estimate Std. Error t value Pr(&gt;|t|)    \n(Intercept) 34.002875   2.642659  12.867 2.82e-13 ***\nwt          -2.878575   0.904971  -3.181 0.003574 ** \nhp          -0.037479   0.009605  -3.902 0.000546 ***\nam           2.083710   1.376420   1.514 0.141268    \n---\nSignif. codes:  0 ‘***’ 0.001 ‘**’ 0.01 ‘*’ 0.05 ‘.’ 0.1 ‘ ’ 1\n\nResidual standard error: 2.538 on 28 degrees of freedom\nMultiple R-squared:  0.8399,\tAdjusted R-squared:  0.8227 \nF-statistic: 48.96 on 3 and 28 DF,  p-value: 2.908e-11</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "code": "## 5. 回归诊断",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "code": "par(mfrow = c(2, 2))\nplot(model)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/389ad984-3168-4c60-97c3-dd6daffc4d52\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "code": "## 6. 置信区间",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "code": "ci <- confint(model, level = 0.95)\ncat(\"95% 置信区间:\\n\")\nprint(round(ci, 4))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "95% 置信区间:\n              2.5 %  97.5 %\n(Intercept) 28.5896 39.4161\nwt          -4.7323 -1.0248\nhp          -0.0572 -0.0178\nam          -0.7358  4.9032",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">95% 置信区间:\n              2.5 %  97.5 %\n(Intercept) 28.5896 39.4161\nwt          -4.7323 -1.0248\nhp          -0.0572 -0.0178\nam          -0.7358  4.9032</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 14,
        "code": "coefs <- coef(model)[-1]\nci_vals <- ci[-1, ]\nn <- length(coefs)\n\npar(mfrow = c(1, 1), mar = c(5, 8, 4, 2))\nplot(coefs, 1:n, xlim = range(ci_vals),\n     pch = 19, col = \"#58a6ff\", cex = 1.5,\n     yaxt = \"n\", xlab = \"估计值\", ylab = \"\",\n     main = \"回归系数的 95% 置信区间\")\naxis(2, at = 1:n, labels = names(coefs), las = 1)\nsegments(ci_vals[, 1], 1:n, ci_vals[, 2], 1:n,\n         lwd = 3, col = \"#58a6ff\")\nabline(v = 0, lty = 2, col = \"#f85149\", lwd = 1.5)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/1163a4ca-6d4c-412e-aaa8-c24bae04c22d\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "code": "## 7. 单因素方差分析 (One-Way ANOVA)\n\n不同气缸数量之间的燃油效率 (MPG) 是否存在显著差异？",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 16,
        "code": "anova_model <- aov(mpg ~ factor(cyl), data = mtcars)\nsummary(anova_model)\ncat(\"\\nTukey HSD 事后多重比较:\\n\")\nTukeyHSD(anova_model)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "            Df Sum Sq Mean Sq F value   Pr(>F)    \nfactor(cyl)  2  824.8   412.4    39.7 4.98e-09 ***\nResiduals   29  301.3    10.4                     \n---\nSignif. codes:  0 ‘***’ 0.001 ‘**’ 0.01 ‘*’ 0.05 ‘.’ 0.1 ‘ ’ 1\n\nTukey HSD 事后多重比较:\n  Tukey multiple comparisons of means\n    95% family-wise confidence level\n\nFit: aov(formula = mpg ~ factor(cyl), data = mtcars)\n\n$`factor(cyl)`\n          diff        lwr        upr     p adj\n6-4  -6.920779 -10.769350 -3.0722086 0.0003424\n8-4 -11.563636 -14.770779 -8.3564942 0.0000000\n8-6  -4.642857  -8.327583 -0.9581313 0.0112287",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">            Df Sum Sq Mean Sq F value   Pr(&gt;F)    \nfactor(cyl)  2  824.8   412.4    39.7 4.98e-09 ***\nResiduals   29  301.3    10.4                     \n---\nSignif. codes:  0 ‘***’ 0.001 ‘**’ 0.01 ‘*’ 0.05 ‘.’ 0.1 ‘ ’ 1\n\nTukey HSD 事后多重比较:\n  Tukey multiple comparisons of means\n    95% family-wise confidence level\n\nFit: aov(formula = mpg ~ factor(cyl), data = mtcars)\n\n$`factor(cyl)`\n          diff        lwr        upr     p adj\n6-4  -6.920779 -10.769350 -3.0722086 0.0003424\n8-4 -11.563636 -14.770779 -8.3564942 0.0000000\n8-6  -4.642857  -8.327583 -0.9581313 0.0112287</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "code": "boxplot(mpg ~ cyl, data = mtcars,\n        main = \"按气缸数划分的 MPG\",\n        xlab = \"气缸数\", ylab = \"英里/加仑\",\n        col = c(\"#58a6ff\", \"#a371f7\", \"#f85149\"))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/0ee3f345-a2d0-416c-9cfb-0479d5049e3c\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 18,
        "code": "## 总结\n\n- **Welch t 检验**：在未调整的单尾比较中，手动挡汽车的平均 MPG 更高\n- **卡方检验**：列联表提示存在关联，但较低的期望频数触发了近似警告，因此需谨慎解读该结果\n- **回归分析**：在调整后，车重和马力 (horsepower) 是显著的负向预测因子；在该模型中变速箱类型不显著\n- **方差分析 (ANOVA)**：4 缸、6 缸和 8 缸组之间的 MPG 差异显著；Tukey 检验结果指出了两两之间的具体差异",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      }
    ]
  }
}